{"id":"648130","name":"盐焗猪耳","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/648130/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪耳朵","amount":"一副"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"红葱头","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜瓣","amount":"适量"},{"name":"沙姜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"猪耳朵。","img":"images/648130/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"配料有姜，葱，蒜，沙姜。","img":"images/648130/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"猪耳朵凉水入锅，放入葱、姜、料酒，焯水十分钟。","img":"images/648130/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"把焯好水的猪耳朵捞出。","img":"images/648130/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"用温水清洗干净。","img":"images/648130/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入盐，蚝油、酱油、老抽、盐焗鸡粉、胡椒粉、料酒，抓拌均匀。","img":"images/648130/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"腌制入味一个小时。","img":"images/648130/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"电饭锅底放油，把所有配料放入。","img":"images/648130/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"把腌制好的猪耳朵也放入电饭锅，再浇入腌制的料汁。","img":"images/648130/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"选了一个焗制功能。","img":"images/648130/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"时间结束，香味扑鼻而来。","img":"images/648130/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。切块上桌。","img":"images/648130/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}